    <statement><p>Perform the following operations on the vectors <m>\vec{u} = \left\lt -3,0,4\right&gt;</m>, <m>\vec{v} = \left\lt -4,-5,-3\right&gt;</m>, and <m>\vec{w} = \left\lt -4,4,1\right&gt;</m>.</p>
<p><m>\vec{u} \cdot \vec{w} =</m> 
<fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><m>(\vec{u} \cdot \vec{v}) \vec{u} =</m> 
<fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
<p><m>((\vec{w} \cdot \vec{w}) \vec{u} ) \cdot \vec{u} =</m> 
<fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
<p><m>\vec{u} \cdot \vec{v} + \vec{v} \cdot \vec{w} =</m> 
<fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0004"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>16</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;0,0,0\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
