    <solution><p>SOLUTION</p>
<p><m>\vec{u} \cdot \vec{w} = \lt -3,0,4&gt; \cdot \lt -4,4,1&gt; = 16</m></p>
<p><m>(\vec{u} \cdot \vec{v}) \vec{u} = 0 \lt -3,0,4&gt; = \lt 0,0,0&gt;</m></p>
<p><m>\begin{array}{lcl} ((\vec{w} \cdot \vec{w}) \vec{u} ) \cdot \vec{u}\amp  =\amp  
(33 \lt -3,0,4&gt;)\cdot \lt -3,0,4&gt; \\\amp =\amp  \lt -99,0,132&gt; \cdot \lt -3,0,4&gt; = 825 \end{array}</m></p>
<p><m>\vec{u} \cdot \vec{v} + \vec{v} \cdot \vec{w} = 0  - 7 = -7</m></p>
</solution>
